The 'event-types' folder contains TypeScript definitions for various event structures that flow through the application, organizing them by system (game client, shattered archive) and event type (GMCP, raw data, server events). These type definitions ensure consistent data handling across different parts of the application, particularly for communication between the game client and remote servers, as well as between user scripts and the shattered archive system. The folder serves as a centralized location for all event type definitions, making it easier to maintain and understand the data flow between different components of the project.
